  "title": "Avison Young selects CGI to deliver AI-powered managed services",
  "summary": "CGI (TSX: GIB.A) (NYSE: GIB), one of the largest independent IT and business consulting services firms in the world, today announced that global commercial real estate advisor Avison Young has selected CGI to deliver AI-powered managed services to strengthen the firm’s digital foundation and accelerate its evolution as a digitally enabled real estate services leader and support the modernization of its digital platforms. The engagement builds on an expanded strategic partnership between the two organizations.",
